        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Additionally, we offer an extensive portfolio of server and storage solutions for enterprise data centers, cloud service providers, and edge computing applications, such as 5G Telco, Retail and embedded.",
        "start_character": 357,
        "end_character": 560
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Based on these forecasts, we place manufacturing orders for our products.",
        "start_character": 40365,
        "end_character": 40438
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In November 2023, the export control restrictions on advanced integrated circuits, supercomputing and other end uses were revised and further expanded to cover additional countries where we sell our products, such as those in the Middle East, as well as additional parties based on the location of their headquarters, or the headquarters of their ultimate parent.",
        "start_character": 28921,
        "end_character": 29284
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In recent years, we have experienced increased competition from original design manufacturers (“ODMs”) that benefit from their scale and very low-cost manufacturing and are increasingly offering their own branded products.",
        "start_character": 24166,
        "end_character": 24388
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our worldwide business activities subject us to various federal, state, local, and foreign laws in the countries in which we operate, and our Total IT Solutions are subject to laws and regulations affecting their sale.",
        "start_character": 25920,
        "end_character": 26138
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Similarly, we work very closely with our customers to understand their needs and develop our new product plans accordingly.",
        "start_character": 16846,
        "end_character": 16969
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Through our strategy, we seek to maintain or improve our relative competitive position in many product areas and pursue markets that provide us with additional long-term growth opportunities.",
        "start_character": 3741,
        "end_character": 3932
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have a series of agreements with Compuware, including multiple product development, production and service agreements, as well as product manufacturing agreements and lease agreements for office space.",
        "start_character": 23058,
        "end_character": 23267
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also provide global support and services to help our customers install, upgrade and maintain their computing infrastructure, including liquid-cooling operations.",
        "start_character": 1010,
        "end_character": 1174
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe our manufacturing strategy allows us to adjust manufacturing capacity in response to changes in customer demand and to rapidly introduce new products to the market.",
        "start_character": 22274,
        "end_character": 22449
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that selectively using outsourced manufacturing services allows us to focus on our core competencies in product design and development, and increases our operational flexibility.",
        "start_character": 22084,
        "end_character": 22273
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001375365-25-000027",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001375365-25-000027-6c1fa53447b5e0ac",
        "accession_number": "0001375365-25-000027",
        "filing_date": "2025-08-28",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We believe that the combination of our focus on internal research and development activities, our close working relationships with local customers and vendors and our modular design approach allows us to decrease time-to-market, improve quality and deliver superior product designs.",
        "start_character": 15522,
        "end_character": 15804
      }
